course: dictionary
lesson: 6734
title: Older and the years between us
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: Older is the comparison of old. When you compare two people or things, older means one has lived more years than the other. «Older Station Road boys tried to recruit Jake» tells you the boys have lived more years than Jake, so they are older than him.
explain: Older can also talk about things. An older house was built or used longer ago than another house. Look at the words around it: if the sentence compares two things, older means they are further back in time.
explain: Look for the word «than». Older usually compares two things, so you will often see «older than». To find how much older, subtract the smaller age from the bigger one. If Maya is 11 and her sister Lia is 8, Maya is 3 years older than Lia.
fact: Older is the comparative of old, used to compare two people or things.
fact: «Older» means having lived more years than someone else.
fact: «Older» can also mean made or used longer ago, as in «an older house».
fact: «How much older» asks you to find the difference in years.
fact: Useful phrases: older than, older brother, older sister, get older.
exercise: In «Older Station Road boys tried to recruit Jake», what does older mean? | Having a bigger house than Jake | *Having lived more years than Jake | Taller than the bus | Friendlier than the teachers
exercise: Maya is 11 and her sister Lia is 8. How much older is Maya? | 19 years | 11 years | *3 years | 8 years
exercise: Which phrase means a sister born before you? | an older house | an older book | *an older sister
test: The bridge built in 1800 and the bridge built in 1950: which one is older? | *the one built in 1800 | the one built in 1950 | they are the same age
test: Sam is 14 and his younger brother Jake is 10. How many years older than Jake is Sam? | *4 years | 10 years | 24 years | 14 years
exam: In «an older house», what does older mean? | More expensive than other houses | Having more years of life, like a person | *Made or used longer ago than another house | Taller than other houses
